vs current: projections + logits = 2*B*L*C*H*D + B*H*L²*D\n= B*H*C*D*(2L + L²/C)\n\nFor our largest case (B=1, H=20, L=256, C=1280, D=64):\n- Current: 2*256*1280*20*64 + 20*256²*64 = 840M + 84M = 924M FLOPs\n- Wqk approach: 20*1280*(1280*64 + 2*256²) = 20*1280*(81920 + 131072) = 20*1280*212992 = 5.45B FLOPs\n\nWay worse! Because C²D dominates (1280² × 64 = 105M per head, ×20 = 2.1B).\n\nOK that's definitely worse.\n\nLet me try yet another angle. What about using `torch.nn.functional.scaled_dot_product_attention`? It's optimized for GPU but might have CPU optimizations too.\n\nLet me try that:\n<br>\n\nLet me benchmark PyTorch's built-in scaled_dot_product_attention:\n<br>\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_40","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"cd /workspace && python3 -c \\\"\nimport torch, time, math\nimport torch.nn.functional as F\ntorch.set_num_threads(1)\n\nB, L, C, H, D = 1, 256, 1280, 20, 64\nalpha, beta = 1.05, 7.5\n\nx = torch.randn(B, L, C)\nwq = torch.randn(H, D, C)\nwk = torch.randn(H, D, C)\nwv = torch.randn(H, D, C)\n\nHD = H * D\nxr = x.reshape(B * L, C)\ninv_sqrt_d = 1.0 / math.sqrt(D)\n\nq = (xr @ wq.reshape(HD, C).T).reshape(B, L, H, D).permute(0, 2, 1, 3).contiguous()\nk = (xr @ wk.reshape(HD, C).T).reshape(B, L, H, D).permute(0, 2, 1, 3).contiguous()\nv = (xr @ wv.reshape(HD, C).T).reshape(B, L, H, D).permute(0, 2, 1, 3).contiguous()\n\n# Current: manual softmax\ndef manual_attn(q, k, v):\n    logits = q @ k.transpose(-1, -2) * inv_sqrt_d\n    p = logits.softmax(dim=-1)\n    return p @ v, logits\n\n# SDPA\ndef sdpa_attn(q, k, v):\n    return F.scaled_dot_product_attention(q, k, v, scale=inv_sqrt_d)\n\nfor _ in range(5):\n    manual_attn(q, k, v)\n    sdpa_attn(q, k, v)\n\nN = 20\nt0 = time.process_time_ns()\nfor _ in range(N):\n    out_manual, logits = manual_attn(q, k, v)\nt1 = time.process_time_ns()\nprint(f'Manual (logits+softmax+matmul): {(t1-t0)/N/1e6:.3f} ms')\n\nt0 = time.process_time_ns()\nfor _ in range(N):\n    out_sdpa = sdpa_attn(q, k, v)\nt1 = time.process_time_ns()\nprint(f'SDPA: {(t1-t0)/N/1e6:.3f} ms')\n\nout_manual, _ = manual_attn(q, k, v)\nout_sdpa = sdpa_attn(q, k, v)\nprint(f'Max diff: {(out_manual - out_sdpa).abs().max():.6e}')\n\\\"\n\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
